@startuml 02_state_rfid_cooldown
title RFID reader cooldown\n(src/sorter/rfid_reader/reader.cpp, COOLDOWN_MS = 1500)
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

[*] --> Ready
state Ready
state Cooldown

Ready --> Ready : no card present\n[returns empty UID]
Ready --> Cooldown : card read OK\n[card halted, UID returned,\n_lastTriggerMs set]
Cooldown --> Cooldown : card seen within 1.5 s\n[halted, ignored, timer NOT reset]
Cooldown --> Ready : 1.5 s elapsed
@enduml
